            "review_title": "Review at Nhà Hàng Mạnh Cường Trâu Cá",
            "review_text": "JSTrip_77\nSarajevo, Bosnia and Herzegovina1194 contributions\n0\nFantastic, Hidden Option for Buffalo BBQ\nDec 2020\nA special treat for meat-lovers is water buffalo. It's not the same as buffalo meat foreigners might be used to. Thit Trau - water buffalo meat restaurants are fantastic ways to explore the Vietnamese culture too. This place is tucked into a side-street but the indoor dining area is expansive. We ate at the tables out on the sidewalk as the day was beautiful. The service was fast and the food very good.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten December 4, 2020",
